# VACASK: SFFM defaults, $abstime, chgtol, the save caveat (062bcac0, part j).
# What the fix was for, as the ledger has it: the control block holds `options chgtol=1e-14`
# before `analysis op1 op`; no `has no spelling in vacask` entry for chgtol.
from: ngspice
to: vacask
--- input
t
R1 a 0 1k
.options chgtol=1e-14
.op
.end
--- output
t
ground 0
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
model resistor sp_resistor
R1 (a 0) resistor r=1k
control
options chgtol=1e-14
analysis op1 op
endc
--- report
